      "notes": "Launched at Senayan City, Jakarta on 15 June 2023. Launch price Rp1,655,000,000 (moladin; kontan rounds to Rp1.65 billion); neither source states OTR or off-the-road, so treat the price basis as unconfirmed. Battery 66.5 kWh not labelled gross/net. DC 100 kW, 10-80% in 32 min. Power, torque and dimensions not in the launch sources. Range 448 km WLTP. Seven seats. Listed at Rp1,685,000,000 in September 2024, then replaced by the EQB 250+ (2025 record). Usable battery 66.5 kWh, power (140 kW), torque (385 Nm), voltage, drive, AC power, connectors, charge port, V2L and frunk from the European spec of the seven-seat EQB 250 (ev-database.org, 2022-2023); matched on variant name and battery. Motor type, length, width and wheelbase from the Australian spec of the EQB 250 (carsales.com.au; 66.5 kWh, 140 kW FWD); the Australian car is a five-seater, so its weight, height and boot figures were not used. Battery check (Nov 2026): Mercedes-Benz quotes usable capacity, so the Indonesian 66.5 kWh figure is stored as usable capacity; gross 69.7 kWh is from the European spec (ev-database.org).",
      "notes_id": "Diluncurkan di Senayan City, Jakarta pada 15 Juni 2023. Harga peluncuran Rp1.655.000.000 (moladin; kontan membulatkan menjadi Rp1,65 miliar); kedua sumber tidak menyebut OTR atau off the road, sehingga dasar harga belum terkonfirmasi. Baterai 66,5 kWh tidak disebut gross/net. DC 100 kW, 10-80% dalam 32 menit. Tenaga, torsi dan dimensi tidak ada di sumber peluncuran. Jarak tempuh 448 km WLTP. Tujuh kursi. Tercantum Rp1.685.000.000 pada September 2024, lalu digantikan EQB 250+ (catatan 2025). Baterai usable 66,5 kWh, daya (140 kW), torsi (385 Nm), tegangan, penggerak, daya AC, konektor, posisi port, V2L, dan frunk dari spesifikasi Eropa untuk EQB 250 tujuh kursi (ev-database.org, 2022-2023); dicocokkan dari nama varian dan baterai. Jenis motor, panjang, lebar, dan jarak sumbu roda dari spesifikasi Australia EQB 250 (carsales.com.au; 66,5 kWh, 140 kW FWD); mobil Australia berkursi lima, jadi angka berat, tinggi, dan bagasinya tidak dipakai. Pemeriksaan baterai (Nov 2026): Mercedes-Benz mencantumkan kapasitas pakai, jadi angka Indonesia 66,5 kWh disimpan sebagai kapasitas pakai; kapasitas kotor 69,7 kWh dari spesifikasi Eropa (ev-database.org)."
